@startuml
title VibeGraph Recommendation Sequence

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "사용자" as User
participant "React Dashboard" as FE
participant "FastAPI\n/recommendations" as RecAPI
participant "GraphRecommendationService" as RecService
participant "Neo4jService" as Neo4jService
database "Neo4j" as Neo4j
participant "FastAPI\n/agent/explain" as AgentAPI
participant "AgentService" as AgentService
participant "OpenAI API" as OpenAI

User -> FE : Graph 추천 생성 클릭
FE -> RecAPI : GET /recommendations/{userId}?limit=10
RecAPI -> RecService : get_recommendations(userId, limit)
RecService -> Neo4jService : get_recommendations(userId, limit)
Neo4jService -> Neo4j : 상위 장르 기반 후보 탐색

alt 후보 있음
  Neo4j --> Neo4jService : candidate tracks + graphPath + score
  Neo4jService --> RecService : list<RecommendedTrack>
  RecService --> RecAPI : candidates
  RecAPI --> FE : 200 OK
  FE -> User : 추천 후보와 graphPath 표시
else 후보 없음
  Neo4j --> Neo4jService : empty result
  Neo4jService --> RecService : []
  RecService --> RecAPI : NoRecommendationsError
  RecAPI --> FE : 500 detail
  FE -> User : 더 많은 플레이리스트 동기화 안내
end

User -> FE : AI 추천 이유 생성 클릭
FE -> AgentAPI : POST /agent/explain\n{userId, candidates, tasteProfile}
AgentAPI -> AgentService : explain_recommendations(candidates, tasteProfile)
AgentService -> OpenAI : JSON 응답 형식으로 추천 이유 요청

alt JSON 응답 성공
  OpenAI --> AgentService : playlistName, explanation, tracks.reason
  AgentService -> AgentService : candidate와 reason 병합
  AgentService --> AgentAPI : AgentExplainResponse
  AgentAPI --> FE : 200 OK
  FE -> User : 플레이리스트 이름과 추천 이유 표시
else LLM 호출 또는 JSON 파싱 실패
  OpenAI --> AgentService : error or invalid JSON
  AgentService --> AgentAPI : LLMError
  AgentAPI --> FE : 500 detail
  FE -> User : AI 설명 생성 오류 표시
end

@enduml
